v 3
d panelline: Small-multiples line plot (FT-style) with end-point dots
d
d One time-series sub-plot per group on a shared y-axis, with an end-point dot
d on each line. Long-format input (panel, time, value).
d
d Requires: Stata 16 or newer.
d
d Author: Wen-Cheng Lin, Academia Sinica
d Source: https://github.com/ganma0517/stata_panelline
d
d Distribution-Date: 20260602
d
